==French==

===Etymology===
{{univerbation|fr}} of {{m|fr|l'|pos=an apocopic form of ''la'', ''la'' before a vowel}} + {{m|fr|endemain}}, itself a univerbation of {{m|fr|en}} and {{m|fr|demain}}. Compare {{cog|it|indomani|l'indomani}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fr-IPA|lend(ə)main}}
